<EditorialPage title="Responsible sourcing starts with clarity." eyebrow="Sustainability & ethics" description="Tell us the material, social and environmental requirements your buyer expects. We review the applicable evidence and production arrangements for your specific garment enquiry.">
<section class="cat-section"><div class="cat-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Evidence with the right scope</p><h2>Ask what the documentation covers.</h2></div></div><div class="option-grid"><article class="option-panel"><h3>Site & social audits</h3><p>Sedex membership and a SMETA audit are not certifications or pass/fail awards. Relevant audit information should identify the site, audit company, date, scope and any follow-up actions.</p></article><article class="option-panel"><h3>Materials & chain of custody</h3><p>Organic and recycled-content claims require applicable evidence for the certified entity, activities, material and delivery. A supplier’s certificate does not automatically certify every garment or Reve’s own site.</p></article><article class="option-panel"><h3>Order-specific requirements</h3><p>Confirm the certificate holder, scope, validity and product or transaction evidence before a certified-material claim is agreed. Testing reports and management-system certificates serve different purposes.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="cat-section"><div class="cat-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A practical conversation</p><h2>Define the brief beyond the garment.</h2></div></div><div class="option-grid">{[['Material choices','Discuss the desired fibre, sourcing route and evidence needed for any organic or recycled-content claim.'],['Production arrangements','Confirm which stages are carried out at the manufacturing site and which use specialist partners for the proposed order.'],['Buyer review','Share your audit, worker-welfare, environmental and documentation requirements early so they can be assessed with the commercial brief.']].map(([title,text])=><article class="option-panel"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="policy-panel"><h3>Specific evidence, not blanket badges</h3><p>Applicable certifications, testing and audit documents are discussed with the team for your requirements. We do not treat a photograph or an unverified percentage as evidence of an environmental outcome.</p></div></div></section>
</EditorialPage>
